    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "mlSlo",
      "x": -440,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Motion Notes",
      "width": 400,
      "height": 720,
      "content": "Apple motion\n\nButton/Primary: highlight on pointer-down, scale 0.97, 100ms. Never wait for click.\n\nLogin / Register: field focus ring is instant on pointer-down; error appears inline under the fields, no modal. Mode switch (登录 ↔ 注册) is a text action — no second primary button. Submit label swaps to 登录中 / 注册中 without locking the field. Prefer reduced-motion: keep color/opacity, drop scale.\n\nCouple / Unbound: copy invite → brief checkmark swap on the primary label (已复制), spring settle damping 1.0 / response 0.3. Bind submit → 绑定中 without locking the code field. Inline error under the input (expired / self / missing) — no modal.\n\nCouple / Bound: days number is the dominant region; anniversary row opens an edit sheet from the row (transform-origin = row). Unbind uses a confirm dialog: scrim materializes (blur+opacity together), dialog springs from 0.96→1, interruptible.\n\nSheets and drawers: spring damping 1.0, response 0.3. Interruptible from the live transform.\n\nPhoto grid: rubber-band at edges; project flick with d=0.998 then spring.\n\nChat: 1:1 with the pointer while dragging the thread; bounce only after a flick.\n\nMessages:\nThread scrolls with 1:1 finger tracking; bounce only after flick (d≈0.998 then spring).\nComposer: text state is menu + input + send. No keyboard icon while already on the keyboard. Voice state is keyboard + menu + hold/recording. No send button in voice.\nBubble enter: opacity+translateY from live value, damping 1.0 / response 0.3 — interruptible.\nSheets (Info / Menu): spring from trigger, transform-origin = toolbar button / menu button; scrim materializes blur+opacity together.\nStatus labels (发送中/已读/对方离线/失败) are metadata under the bubble — never block input.\nFailed retry: tap the failed meta to resend; no modal. History stays visible — never replace the thread with an error page.\nUnbound: one card, one primary CTA. Connection loss keeps history on screen; no dedicated empty or error screens.\nReduced motion: cross-fade bubbles and sheets; drop bounce and scale.\n\nMessages · Menu: + opens a menu above the button (语音 / 照片 / 视频). Open state swaps the icon to x. Selecting 语音 enters Voice Idle. Selecting 照片/视频 picks from the album. Interruptible.\nMessages · Voice: menu 语音 enters Voice Idle (键盘 + 菜单 + 按住说话, no send). Hold → Recording (松开发送). Slide up past cancel threshold → Cancel (松开取消, danger). Release in cancel discards; release in record sends. Keyboard returns to text. Interruptible at every step."
    },
